title: Palo Alto: CPU Utilization (XML API)
agents: palo_alto_api
catalog: hw/network/palo_alto
license: GPLv3
distribution: kuhn-ruess
description:
 This check monitors the CPU utilization of the data plane(s) and the management
 plane of a Palo Alto Networks firewall. The one-minute average load is read
 from {show system state} through the PAN-OS XML API.

 The service goes {WARN} or {CRIT} when the utilization exceeds the configured
 upper levels (default 80 / 90 %).

item:
 The plane: {Data Plane} (or {Data Plane N} on multi-dataplane systems) and
 {Management Plane}.

discovery:
 One service is created for each detected plane.
